"Adds HTTP security response headers to all responses. Protects against "
"clickjacking, MIME sniffing, XSS, and protocol downgrade attacks."
msgstr ""
"Fügt allen Antworten HTTP-Sicherheits-Antwort-Header hinzu. Schützt vor "
"Clickjacking, MIME-Sniffing, XSS und Protokoll-Downgrade-Angriffen."

